#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-CG0451 expect=noViolation domain=TS
#note "PLAN-per-row-functions phase 0, D4 (absent column = a constant of its type's default, D34 #3/#4): TS carries no TSVALCD column at all. The rule requires only TSPARMCD, so it RUNS; the absent code column reads blank on every row, and a blank is valid -> no finding. Pre-port: the operation answered null for the absent column and no row fired - the same verdict."
#library standard=sdtmig version=3-3
#dictionaries dummy
dataset TS
col STUDYID  type=Char
col DOMAIN   type=Char
col TSSEQ    type=Num
col TSPARMCD type=Char
col TSVAL    type=Char
---
S01 | TS | 1 | TRT | PARACETAMOL
